---
import ProjectLayout from "@layouts/ProjectLayout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import H2 from "@components/h2.astro";

import automatization from "@assets/automatization.jpg";
---

<ProjectLayout>
    <div
        class="p-4 sm:pt-8 sm:px-12 pb-20 min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between gap-32"
    >
        <div class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-12">
            <H2 size="large"> Software creation</H2>

            <div
                class="flex relative w-full aspect-[11/5] rounded-sm mb-4 xl:mb-4 sm:mb-0 sm:mr-4"
            >
                <Image
                    src={automatization}
                    alt="Lapland shoot"
                    class="w-full aspect-[11/5] object-center object-cover rounded-sm mb-4 xl:mb-4 sm:mb-0 sm:mr-4 opacity-80 duration-300"
                />
            </div>

            <!--Creo que no se esta aplicando el plugin de tailwind en estos <p> -->
            <ul class="w-full grid sm:grid-row-3 gap-16 sm:gap-8">
                <p
                    class="grid flex-row relative w-full h-full text-gray-300 justify-center text-[18px]"
                >
                    Worked on projects for filtering data from different customers. Like Telefonica, PC Components working with UST.
                    Also making automatization process for developing fastly and effient data. <strong>Mostly worked with apache Airflow, SQL and python.</strong>

                </p>
                <br>
                <p class="grid flex-row relative w-full h-full text-gray-300 justify-center text-[18px]">
                    <strong>Software and Video Game Development Engineer.</strong> Projects made with BLUREDTEAM, Independet group of developers.
                    I specialized in Various Blender props. I made multiplayer games with Unity. I know C++ very well and also with OpenGL.
                </p>
            </ul>

            <ul class="w-full sm:mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-16 sm:gap-8">
                <div
                    class="grid relative w-full h-full text-gray-300 justify-center"
                >
                    <H2 size="default">Big Data Analysis</H2>
                    <div
                        class="grid relative w-full h-full text-gray-300 justify-center md:mt-0"
                    >
                        <p
                            class="grid flex-row relative w-full h-full text-gray-300 justify-center pb-0 pt-2"
                        >
                        <br>
                            
                        </p>

                        <ol class="grid grid-rows-3 relative md:pt-2 pb-0">
                            <li class="flex relative md:pl-5 pb-0">
                                <strong>Cinematic shoots for the movie "Danza Macabra"</strong>
                                by Ana Wilkszinski, Madrid 2024
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex relative md:pl-5 pb-0">
                                <strong>ESN Montage of cinematic views for promoting</strong>
                                Erasmus experiences, Malmo 2023
                            </li>
                            <br>
                            <li class="flex relative md:pl-5 pb-0">
                                Also this aircraft it had been used for
                                recreational and study purposes in
                                Riga, Lapland, Copenhagen and Tenerife.
                            </li>
                        </ol>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div
                    class="grid relative w-full h-fullt text-gray-300 justify-center"
                >
                    <H2 size="default">Game Development</H2>
                    <div
                        class="grid relative w-full h-full text-gray-300 justify-center md:mt-0"
                    >
                        <p
                            class="grid flex-row relative w-full h-full text-gray-300 justify-center pb-0 pt-2"
                        >
                            First-person-view (FPV) drone, is built for
                            fast-paced, immersive footage. It excels in
                            action-heavy environments — such as music videos,
                            sports, or entertainment projects where movement and
                            intensity matter.

                            <ol class="grid grid-rows-3 relative md:pt-2">
                                <li class="flex relative md:pl-5 pb-0">
                                    <strong>Tracking cars and racing footage for
                                    Nuin&Kapatropa Productions,</strong> Alicante 2024
                                </li>
                            </ol>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </ul>

            <!--Down here goes a vento grid -->
        </div>
    </div>
</ProjectLayout>